DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The rrttssxx driver provides support for Realtek SD card reader.  Driver at‐
     taches mmc bus on card insertion and detaches it on card removing.

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The rrttssxx driver supports different specification compatible chips.  The
     following chips have been verified to work:

     ••   RTS5209
     ••   RTS5227
     ••   RTS5229
     ••   RTS522A
     ••   RTS525A
     ••   RTS5260
     ••   RTL8411B

     It should also work for:

     ••   RTS5249
     ••   RTL8402
     ••   RTL8411

