     ••   RTS522A on Lenovo T470p, card detection and read-only switch are re‐
         versed.  This is solved by adding in _l_o_a_d_e_r_._c_o_n_f_(_5_):

         ddeevv..rrttssxx..00..iinnvveerrssiioonn==11

         The driver tries to automate those exceptions.  If this automation is
         wrong, it can be avoided by adding in _l_o_a_d_e_r_._c_o_n_f_(_5_):

         ddeevv..rrttssxx..00..iinnvveerrssiioonn==00

     ••   Mounting a filesystem with write access on a card write protected may
         involve a kernel crash.

     ••   Suspend/Resume do not work under MMCCAM.

     ••   For some chips (e.g. RTS5260) after ddeevvccttll ddiissaabbllee//eennaabbllee or
